What is/are the main reason(s) for your 
interest in Lojban? 

  o I like the sounds of the language (euphony) 
  o I like the internal structure of the language (bridi instead of sentences, tanru, collapsing nouns, adjectives, adverbs and verbs into selbri, having both time and space tenses, etc.) 
